We need to add sounds. We added Audio objects. Need to trigger sounds in appropriate places: on dash, on hit, on orb collected, on game over. We'll edit update and draw sections. Also ensure sounds play only once per event. In collision handling we can play hit sound. For dash we play dash sound when dash activated. For orb, play orb sound. For game over in loop when health <=0, play gameOver.

